"On a final note, the Homerun Goes Death stage revealed a character that any fan of the game has seen. That horrid, grotesque monster, with the one eye dangling down and odd misshapen head that we've seen in all screen shots from day 1 on has gotten a name. Mr. Banballow. This seems like it may be the final game boss, if you have to defeat the stages in a certain order. Otherwise, why single out this one villain? His pic is included under the Minnesota Hell Cinema preview, and the captain states..."This is a popular stage that illustrated a father's revenge for the death of his son. The 90 mph running room is sure to give you a hell of a scare. Come meet the famous main character Banbollow." What does this all mean? We shall see...<p>
