<b>Overall:</b> 8<p>
"I would recommend Daytona USA for a purchase. Before trying out the game, everyone should be aware of how important it is to drive smart in the game. If you drive carelessly and don’t pay close attention to precision, you will not be very successful in Daytona USA. To add some life to the game, it would have been interesting to be able to make your own car. The cars you are given have preset tunings and you cannot alter them. By being able to build your own car you could make it run exactly how you like. You would also be able to succeed on every track because you could change the settings to make them suitable for each specific track."<p>
